  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_01",
      "hash64": "6DEE340AD5E42AF7",
      "text": "Le centre culturel est un endroit où les gens\\ndu coin se réunissent pour étudier, bavarder\\r\\nou se détendre.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_02",
      "hash64": "6DEE350AD5E42CAA",
      "text": "Tu es allé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à la fête ? Elle vient tout juste\\nde commencer, alors profites-en.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_03",
      "hash64": "6DEE360AD5E42E5D",
      "text": "C’était quoi tout ce tapage au Parc Adorami ?\\c\\nOn n’avait pourtant prévu aucun feu d’artifice !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_04",
      "hash64": "6DEE2F0AD5E42278",
      "text": "Je ne m’attendais pas à ce qu’Ogerpon\\nait une bouille si mignonne !\\c\\n... Je me demande si l’intendant serait d’accord\\npour qu’on fabrique des articles à son effigie.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_01",
      "hash64": "9DE024348DAB6DFC",
      "text": "Paldea est une région connue pour sa prestigieuse\\nécole, si je ne me trompe pas !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_02",
      "hash64": "9DE027348DAB7315",
      "text": "Que serait la Fête des Visages sans ses fameuses\\nglaces pilées ?\\c\\nJe te conseille celle au parfum « Mers d’Alola ».\\nPar contre, je te préviens, ta langue risque\\r\\nde devenir bleue !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_03",
      "hash64": "9DE026348DAB7162",
      "text": "Quel vacarme dehors !\\nLes Adoramis sont revenus à la vie ou quoi ?\\c\\n... Je rigole ! Comme si ça pouvait arriver, ha ha !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_04",
      "hash64": "9DE021348DAB68E3",
      "text": "Est-ce que tu as rencontré Ogerpon ?\\c\\nJe parie que les masques du Monstre seront\\ntrès populaires l’année prochaine !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
